Requirement=Templar IS
Reply Text=Your grace, I'm a Knight Templar, at your service.
Go to node ID=01 Conversation Start Templar

Requirement=Inquisitor IS
Reply Text=Your grace, I'm an Inquisitor, at your service.
Go to node ID=01 Conversation Start Inquisitor

Requirement=Speech moreequal 20
Reply Text=Your holiness, though my heritage is tainted, my heart is true. 
Go to node ID=20 Audience

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I wanted to ask you some questions. 
Go to node ID=20 Audience

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Vile? Watch your tongue, Inquisitor, or I'll cut it out.
Go to node ID=15 Confront
