Requirement=!None
Reply Text=My blood is what it is. Is there nothing a tainted soul can do for the Church?
Go to node ID=200 Tainted Audience

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Nevermind. Goodbye.
Go to node ID=10 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
