Node ID=15 Confront
Text=So, there *is* the spark of hellfire in your diabolic soul. You are brash and uncouth, but even one such as you can be redeemed...through deed and action befitting one such as yourself. Are you interested in redemption, or do you wish to continue to wallow in wickedness?
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Your holiness, I seek redemption and will do what you ask.
Go to node ID=70 Tasks

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I'm interested in work, but spare me the redemption sermon.
Go to node ID=15 Confront Goodbye

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I warned you before to drop the sanctimonious attitude.
Go to node ID=15 Confront goodbye

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Nevermind. Goodbye.
Go to node ID=10 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=15 Confront goodbye
Text=Though you would be an asset to my cause, your unwillingness to seek forgiveness is too serious to ignore. You are beyond my help - leave this place until until such time as you seek redemption for your sins.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 english influence
Text=The English long have held the territories in northern France, and their pagan influence has spread across France like an infection. It has become harder of late to convince the common folk not to accept the dark embrace of magic. It will only become more difficult unless we can squelch the heretical practices of the wizards and druids of the English Isles.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have other questions.
Go to node ID=20 Audience

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I should go now.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
